"Tidak."

30:23.947 --> 30:24.948
"Tidak."

30:26.366 --> 30:27.367
"Tidak."

30:28.910 --> 30:29.911
"Tidak."

30:31.996 --> 30:32.997
"Tidak."

30:36.125 --> 30:37.794
